  "aboutParagraphs": [
    "Northside Christian Church plays over the entire church campus in Spring with a large variety of shots — from long, USDGC-style par 4s to tight wooded fairways — across 6,574 feet at par 57. Four water hazards keep the round honest.",
    "Free to play with concrete tees and Mach 5 baskets, and very cart friendly. It's the rare church course that demands a full bag: power on the par 4s, precision in the woods, and nerve around the water.",
    "Check the schedule — the course is best played when services aren't in session."
  ],
